1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:02,419
This is the Strategic Account Desk,

2
00:00:02,439 --> 00:00:06,193
an independent concept I built for Harmonic's Strategic GTM

3
00:00:06,213 --> 00:00:07,152
Associate role.

4
00:00:07,172 --> 00:00:10,926
It's the Monday view: three seller lanes, three slots each,

5
00:00:10,946 --> 00:00:12,269
eight of nine active.

6
00:00:12,289 --> 00:00:15,724
Fit, timing and route readiness are scored separately,

7
00:00:15,744 --> 00:00:17,387
and unknown stays unknown.

8
00:00:18,107 --> 00:00:20,986
Seller A is full, so Larchmont is parked.

9
00:00:21,006 --> 00:00:24,098
Reactivating it into a full lane is refused.

10
00:00:24,118 --> 00:00:28,200
Moving it to Seller C, who has room, fills the ninth slot.

11
00:00:28,920 --> 00:00:31,347
JPMorganChase is the one real account.

12
00:00:31,367 --> 00:00:35,017
It's a prospect hypothesis built only from the bank's own

13
00:00:35,037 --> 00:00:35,854
public pages.

14
00:00:35,874 --> 00:00:39,331
Every sentence in the ledger carries its source, date,

15
00:00:39,351 --> 00:00:41,005
confidence and provenance,

16
00:00:41,025 --> 00:00:44,353
and the unmapped data governance seat stays unknown.

17
00:00:45,073 --> 00:00:47,544
A shared investor isn't an introduction.

18
00:00:47,564 --> 00:00:49,910
This route is public affiliation only,

19
00:00:49,930 --> 00:00:53,709
so asking for an intro is blocked, whatever boxes get ticked.

20
00:00:54,429 --> 00:00:58,065
Brightwater is a synthetic demo route with the relationship,

21
00:00:58,085 --> 00:01:01,661
the introducer's permission and the recipient all verified.

22
00:01:01,681 --> 00:01:04,220
The desk prepares an intro request ticket.

23
00:01:04,240 --> 00:01:05,195
Nothing is sent.

24
00:01:05,915 --> 00:01:07,785
Signals have a shelf life.

25
00:01:07,805 --> 00:01:11,490
The CISO's 2025 supplier letter is past its window,

26
00:01:11,510 --> 00:01:14,615
so it can't be the reason to reach out now.

27
00:01:14,635 --> 00:01:17,158
Unsourced rumours are rejected too.

28
00:01:17,878 --> 00:01:21,081
The brief is exactly five sentences: situation,

29
00:01:21,101 --> 00:01:23,824
sourced trigger, stakeholder hypothesis,

30
00:01:23,844 --> 00:01:25,675
route with its uncertainty,

31
00:01:25,695 --> 00:01:28,487
and the next step with an owner and date.

32
00:01:28,507 --> 00:01:32,259
If I claim a board member knows the CISO, it's blocked:

33
00:01:32,279 --> 00:01:35,413
six sentences, and an unverified relationship.

34
00:01:35,433 --> 00:01:36,922
Recompose restores it.

35
00:01:37,642 --> 00:01:41,179
Meridian stalled after an event because no one owned the

36
00:01:41,199 --> 00:01:41,814
follow-up.

37
00:01:41,834 --> 00:01:45,625
It can't resume until it has an owner and a dated next step.

38
00:01:45,645 --> 00:01:48,419
Assign Seller B, add the action, set a date,

39
00:01:48,439 --> 00:01:50,452
and it moves back to find route.

40
00:01:51,172 --> 00:01:55,218
The trust page tries to break the desk's own rules against live

41
00:01:55,238 --> 00:01:55,605
state.

42
00:01:55,625 --> 00:01:56,960
All eight tests pass.

43
00:01:56,980 --> 00:02:00,703
Every measure shows its numerator, denominator and window.

44
00:02:00,723 --> 00:02:03,220
Meetings and pipeline say not measured,

45
00:02:03,240 --> 00:02:04,963
because they need CRM data.

46
00:02:05,683 --> 00:02:09,230
That's the job as I'd run it: nine honest campaigns,

47
00:02:09,250 --> 00:02:12,660
routes that hold up, and briefs a seller can send.

48
00:02:12,680 --> 00:02:14,787
The first thirty days are here.

49
00:02:14,807 --> 00:02:16,159
Thanks for watching.

